  "summary": "Solid, natural Spanish with good subjunctive coverage. Gaps: six generic hints, missing tú/usted and feminine alternatives, the calque 'escribir eso para mí', and 'no estaríamos corriendo' for 'we wouldn't be rushing'. The about-english lint on sp-es-b2-15 is a false alarm.",
